                     <biblList xml:id="biblList_70c6f2ef">
                        <head xml:id="head_N20488">Evidence</head>
                     </biblList>
                  </event>
               </eventList>
               <p xml:id="idm199">In October / November 1847 Hartmann sat music to three poems from B.S. Ingemann's "Salomons Ring": "Salomons Sang i Viinhaven"; "Salomons Sang blandt Nomaderne"; and "Sulamiths Sang bag Gitteret". The last two were published separately in December 1848, whereas "Salomons Sang i Viinhaven" was published for the first time in 1864. About 1885 it was incorporated in a new edition of "Sulamiths og Salomons Sange" which had been published for the first time in December 1850.</p>
            </history>
